      en: ["Located in Old Havana along the Avenida del Puerto waterfront.", "Built on the site of a former Spanish artillery barracks.", "The name 'Maestranza' refers to the site's military history.", "Offers direct views of the harbor entrance and El Morro fortress.", "Renovated as part of the Office of the City Historian's projects.", "Primary children's recreation area within the UNESCO World Heritage site."],
